        <div class="member-container">
            <div class="member-profile-card">
                <div class="member-header">
                    <div class="member-title-section">
                        <h1 class="member-name">Mor Katz Avrahami</h1>
                        
                        <p class="primary-role">Analyst</p>                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="member-content">
                    <div class="member-bio">
                        <p>Mor Katz Avrahami has extensive experience advising leading entities in the Israeli economy on regulatory compliance, complex financial processes, financing strategies, and advanced valuation modeling. Mor specializes in payment solutions, clearing infrastructures, and banking regulations related to capital, liquidity, and international trade.</p><p>Previously, she served as an attorney in the Markets Division of the Israel Competition Authority, focusing on financial sectors.</p><p>Mor is a licensed attorney with five years of experience. She holds an LL.B. (magna cum laude) and an MBA from Reichman University.</p>                    </div>
                    
                                        
                                        
                                    </div>
            </div>
            
